('22', '1', '2026-09-12 09:25:21', '2026-09-12 09:25:21', 'Get this Indian Natural Hair Body Wave Crochet Human Hair — lightweight, reusable, and designed for effortless installation even if you’re a first-timer. Pre-separated strands with an invisible string design (no knots, no slippage) give a natural, seamless finish.\r\n\r\n<strong>Specifications:</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Hair Name: Crochet Human Hair Extension</li>\r\n 	<li>Hair Texture: Body Wave</li>\r\n 	<li>Length: 18 inches</li>\r\n 	<li>Weight: 280–300g per pack (3 bundles)</li>\r\n 	<li>Color: Natural Black</li>\r\n 	<li>Quality: 100% Virgin Human Hair, No Chemical Process</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<strong>Why you’ll love it:</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Pre-separated, pre-made strands — time-saving, easy installation</li>\r\n 	<li>Can be curled, straightened, dyed, or bleached</li>\r\n 	<li>Soft, natural feel that resists tangling</li>\r\n 	<li>Reusable — lasts 2–3 years with proper care</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<strong>How to install:</strong>\r\n<ol>\r\n 	<li>Braid your hair and pull a strand out from the loop</li>\r\n 	<li>Thread the crochet hook through the braid</li>\r\n 	<li>Pull the yarn down from the crochet</li>\r\n 	<li>Done — it’s that simple!</li>\r\n</ol>', 'Indian Natural Hair - Body Wave Crochet Human Hair - 18 Inch (Beginner Friendly)', '18\" Body Wave Crochet Human Hair — lightweight, reusable, beginner-friendly with an invisible string design. 100% Virgin Human Hair.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>18\" x 4 Bundle</li>\r\n 	<li>Weight 240~290Grm</li>\r\n 	<li>Condition - New</li>\r\n 	<li>Unprocessed</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n&nbsp;', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'indian-natural-hair-body-wave-crochet-human-hair-18-inch', '', '', '2026-09-12 12:25:35', '2026-09-12 12:25:35', '', '0', 'https://clearance.co.ke/?product=oq-hair-natural-flow-body-wave-crochet-human-hair-18-inch-beginner-friendly', '0', 'product', '', '32'),
