('36', '1', '2026-09-12 09:32:50', '2026-09-12 09:32:50', 'Get the  HAIR Natural Flow Body Wave Crochet Human Hair — lightweight, reusable, and designed for effortless installation even if you’re a first-timer. Pre-separated strands with an invisible string design (no knots, no slippage) give a natural, seamless finish.\n\n<strong>Specifications:</strong>\n<ul>\n 	<li>Hair Name: Crochet Human Hair Extension</li>\n 	<li>Hair Texture: Body Wave</li>\n 	<li>Length: 18 inches</li>\n 	<li>Weight: 110g per bundle</li>\n 	<li>Color: Natural Black</li>\n 	<li>Quality: 100% Virgin Human Hair, No Chemical Process</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>Why you’ll love it:</strong>\n<ul>\n 	<li>Pre-separated, pre-made strands — time-saving, easy installation</li>\n 	<li>Can be curled, straightened, dyed, or bleached</li>\n 	<li>Soft, natural feel that resists tangling</li>\n 	<li>Reusable — lasts 2–3 years with proper care</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>How to install:</strong>\n<ol>\n 	<li>Braid your hair and pull a strand out from the loop</li>\n 	<li>Thread the crochet hook through the braid</li>\n 	<li>Pull the yarn down from the crochet</li>\n 	<li>Done — it’s that simple!</li>\n</ol>', 'Indian HAIR Natural Flow Body Wave Human Hair - 18 Inch', '18\" Body Wave Crochet Human Hair — lightweight, reusable, beginner-friendly with an invisible string design. 100% Virgin Human Hair.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '22-autosave-v1', '', '', '2026-09-12 09:32:50', '2026-09-12 09:32:50', '', '22', 'https://clearance.co.ke/?p=36', '0', 'revision', '', '0'),
('38', '1', '2026-09-12 11:35:17', '2026-09-12 11:35:17', '', '', '', 'draft', 'closed', 'closed', '', '', '', '', '2026-09-12 11:35:17', '2026-09-12 11:35:17', '', '0', 'https://clearance.co.ke/?post_type=shop_order_placehold&p=38', '0', 'shop_order_placehold', '', '0'),
('41', '1', '2026-09-12 11:48:29', '2026-09-12 11:48:29', '<p>Say goodbye to painful, awkward nail trimming. This battery-powered automatic nail clipper takes the guesswork (and the pain) out of the process &#8212; simply insert your fingertip into the trimming slot and let the device do the rest.</p>\n<p><strong>Why you&#8217;ll love it:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Automatic trimming &#8212; no squeezing or manual clipping required</li>\n<li>Smooth, controlled cut that reduces the risk of cutting too deep</li>\n<li>Compact, one-handed design that is easy to use</li>\n<li>LED power indicator light</li>\n<li>Battery-powered &#8212; cordless and easy to use anywhere</li>\n</ul>\n<p>A safer, more comfortable alternative to a basic manual nail clipper &#8212; ideal for everyday use.</p>', 'Battery powered Nail shaper and polisher', 'Battery-powered automatic nail clipper &#8212; insert your fingertip and it trims smoothly and safely, no painful squeezing required.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'battery-powered-nail-cutter', '', '', '2026-09-12 12:28:39', '2026-09-12 12:28:39', '', '0', 'https://clearance.co.ke/?post_type=product&#038;p=41', '1', 'product', '', '0'),
